{"id":"c27p7yvssgvus5ftno4gnpkw8","title":"新属Pelseria以植物学家命名","originalTitle":"New daisy genus named after botanist","summary":"植物学家Pieter Pelser因其对植物进化研究的贡献，新建立的南美雏菊属Pelseria以他的名字命名。Pelser的研究发现，一种长期归类于Senecio属的植物实际上演化出了独立的路径。尽管Pelser从未亲眼见过Pelseria野生植物，这一荣誉仍是对他的研究工作的认可。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-daisy-genus-botanist.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T22:30:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T22:46:34.402Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T22:46:34.402Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b1887f15-da56-4671-8bc0-fb45586dc9af","title":"南美雏菊属以植物学家Pieter Pelser命名"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b1887f15-da56-4671-8bc0-fb45586dc9af","title":"南美雏菊属以植物学家Pieter Pelser命名"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fAotXcgZ5b8Q","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}